  "description": "‘I'm here to see you.’\n\n‘If you're not going to have sex with me, then I've got no reason to hang out with you.’\n\nJung Da-um has dreamed of erecting a building in his name since he was a child. At last, Da-um thought he was finally one step closer to fulfilling that dream - until a client, Kang Min-hyuk, showed up like a calamity!\n\nOnce a friend, once a sexual partner. Why did he come back to Da-um now, after their relationship didn't end well?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/landing/episode/11129), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1515039119), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/dnflrhksrPsmsalrhksr), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/miwangong), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000070879), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12803701), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250435)",
